# Review Workflow

- Use `vault_review` for the default review path. It already aggregates overview, recent activity, work queue, themes, gaps, bridges, stale seeds, orphan notes, and important items.
- Use `topic_packet` with `mode="review"` when the user wants a conversational, topic-scoped review bundle.
- Use `draft_from_topic` when review findings should become a note, task, or decision draft before any write happens.
- Read `ztlctl://review/dashboard`, `ztlctl://garden/backlog`, and `ztlctl://decision-queue` when the MCP client supports resources.
- Use `decision_support` when the user needs evidence around a single topic or decision.
- Recommend concrete actions after review:
  - notes to create
  - links to add
  - seeds to develop
  - tasks to prioritize
